\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   God of goodness and righteousness,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Thou created us in Thine image,
\par And Thou want us to see Thee.
\par Thou bless and make us to prosper
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And you 'll be pleased to dwell in us,
\par But thou created marriage.
\par See. these people stand before Thee,
\par Shed thy blessings upon them all,
\par Make them keep Thine companionship.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Thou Jesus, the head of Thy Church,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The church is thy earthly body,
\par With great care thou attend them.
\par Thou hast purchased them by thy blood,
\par and redeemed them from all their sins
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And made them thine companions.
\par We beseech thee, give Thy love,
\par Unto husband and unto wife,
\par That They may love Thee and themselves.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.   Father and Son and Holy Ghost,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Thou showers the good things of God,
\par Unto the faitful hearted,
\par Thou sanctify both flesh and soul
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Changing into Thine Holy home,
\par Where the Lord doth reign supreme.
\par Take these, and change into Thine home
\par And dwell in them eternally,
\par So that they'll have eternal life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.   Father, Saviour and Holy Ghost,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 We beseech Thee to dwell in us,
\par Bless and give us salvation,
\par Sanctify us and stay with us,
\par Make us become well pleased with Thee,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Find us when we go amiss!
\par And when our death is close at hand,
\par Come and take us up to heaven,
\par \pard       So that we shall glorify Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

